---
source: crates/yard-cli/tests/db.rs
expression: stdout(&out)
---
postgres-17  running
  Host      127.0.0.1
  Port      5433
  User      me
  Password  (none)
  Socket    /Users/me/.yard/run  (the directory; a client takes it as the host)
  URL       postgresql://me@127.0.0.1:5433

  TablePlus: yard db open [database], or paste the URL
  DBeaver, DataGrip, Postico: a new PostgreSQL connection with the fields above

redis  running
  Host      127.0.0.1
  Port      6380
  Password  (none)
  URL       redis://127.0.0.1:6380

  TablePlus: paste the URL
  Another Redis client: a connection to the host and port above

For agents and scripts: yard db connect --json
